class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span> (fixed effective coding, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{\\mathsf{diag},\\mathcal E}\">\\(L_{\\mathsf{diag},\\mathcal E}\\)</span> (diagonal nonacceptance language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c57f7e70a2bf0e74\" href=\"?note=c57f7e70a2bf0e74\" title=\"73-df-binary-diagonal-nonacceptance\">73-df-binary-diagonal-nonacceptance</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf 2}\">\\(\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf 2}\\)</span> (binary recognizable languages, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"11b19b6d211be8ab\" href=\"?note=11b19b6d211be8ab\" title=\"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages\">73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}language\\text{-}not\\text{-}recognizable}\\vdash\nL_{\\mathsf{diag},\\mathcal E}\\notin\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf 2}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}language\\text{-}not\\text{-}recognizable}\\vdash\nL_{\\mathsf{diag},\\mathcal E}\\notin\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf 2}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>If some machine recognizes this language, canonical renaming from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a> gives a recognizer <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\">\\(R\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\)</span> for the same language. Its valid self-code lies in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{\\mathsf{diag},\\mathcal E}\">\\(L_{\\mathsf{diag},\\mathcal E}\\)</span> exactly when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> does not accept that code, whereas recognition says membership is equivalent to acceptance—a contradiction.</li>\n<li>Nonacceptance includes rejection and divergence; replacing it by rejection would destroy the diagonal argument.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-diagonal-nonacceptance","status":"resolved","id":"c57f7e70a2bf0e74","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-diagonal-nonacceptance]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages","status":"resolved","id":"11b19b6d211be8ab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ with $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$ (fixed effective coding, see [[73-df-binary-program-coding]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-diagonal-nonacceptance","status":"resolved","id":"c57f7e70a2bf0e74","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L_{\\mathsf{diag},\\mathcal E}$ (diagonal nonacceptance language, see [[73-df-binary-diagonal-nonacceptance]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages","status":"resolved","id":"11b19b6d211be8ab","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf 2}$ (binary recognizable languages, see [[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"If some machine recognizes this language, canonical renaming from [[73-df-binary-program-coding]] gives a recognizer $R\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}$ for the same language. Its valid self-code lies in $L_{\\mathsf{diag},\\mathcal E}$ exactly when $R$ does not accept that code, whereas recognition says membership is equivalent to acceptance—a contradiction.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"L_{\\mathsf{diag},\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf 2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}language\\text{-}not\\text{-}recognizable}\\vdash\nL_{\\mathsf{diag},\\mathcal E}\\notin\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf 2}","display":true},{"tex":"R\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}","display":false},{"tex":"L_{\\mathsf{diag},\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":1565,"backlinks":[{"id":"fd777d11b311e27a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"A decider for $A_{\\mathsf{TM},\\mathcal E}$ would decide the diagonal language: reject ill-formed codes, and on a valid code $x=\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}$ negate the decider's answer on $\\langle x,x\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}$. That contradicts [[73-thm-binary-diagonal-nonrecognizability]]."},{"id":"220711a8be5be7e0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["db96cabedd089e5f",